\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.1}{\ignorespaces Transmission belt model: a single Firm changing price to target zero stock. Vertical lines indicate where stock crosses the y axis. As stock hits zero, however, price is far from its equilibrium value and both stock and prices oscillate. \relax }}{191}
